---
layout: base.njk
title: Lokesh Dangi — DevOps / Platform Engineer
description: DevOps / Platform Engineer specializing in Kubernetes platform engineering, GitOps, and container supply-chain security.
---
<section class="hero container--wide" data-reveal>
  <p class="hero__eyebrow">// {{ site.role | lower }}</p>
  <h1 class="hero__title">Lokesh Dangi</h1>
  <p class="hero__lede">
    I work on Kubernetes and cloud infrastructure at Appointy — container security, GitOps,
    and the Terraform platform that provisions and runs it.
  </p>
  <div class="hero__ctas">
    <a href="#projects" class="btn btn--primary">View work</a>
    <a href="{{ site.resume }}" class="btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Resume</a>
    <a href="#contact" class="btn">Contact</a>
  </div>
  <div class="hero__socials">
    <a href="{{ site.github }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
    <a href="{{ site.linkedin }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
    <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">Email</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section container" id="about" data-reveal>
  <p class="section__eyebrow">01 · about</p>
  <h2 class="section__title">About</h2>
  <div class="about__grid">
    <div class="about__body">
      <p>
        I'm a DevOps / Platform Engineer at Appointy, working on Kubernetes and cloud
        infrastructure day to day. I maintain our container security standard and the CI/CD
        pipeline behind it, enforce Kyverno policies across our clusters, and deploy applications
        through Helm and ArgoCD as part of our GitOps setup. I also help run the Terraform
        platform we use to provision GCP infrastructure for new clients — cutting setup from a
        few days to under an hour — along with a companion module that provisions monitoring
        alerts for each client in minutes.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section container" id="experience" data-reveal>
  <p class="section__eyebrow">02 · experience</p>
  <h2 class="section__title">Experience</h2>
  <div class="timeline__item">
    <div class="timeline__header">
      <span class="timeline__company">Appointy</span>
      <span class="timeline__dates">Jan 2025 — Present</span>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline__roles">
      <div class="timeline__role">
        <span class="timeline__role-title">DevOps / Platform Engineer</span>
        <span class="timeline__role-dates">Jul 2025 — Present</span>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline__role">
        <span class="timeline__role-title">DevOps Intern</span>
        <span class="timeline__role-dates">Jan 2025 — Jun 2025</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section container--wide" id="projects" data-reveal>
  <p class="section__eyebrow">03 · projects</p>
  <h2 class="section__title">Featured Projects</h2>
  <div class="projects__grid">
    {% for project in projects %}
    <article class="card">
      <div class="card__meta">
        <span><span class="status-dot"></span>{{ project.status }}</span>
        <span>{{ project.role }}</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="card__title">{{ project.title }}</h3>
      <p class="card__summary">{{ project.summary }}</p>
      <div class="card__tags">
        {% for tag in project.tags %}<span class="chip">{{ tag }}</span>{% endfor %}
      </div>
      {% if project.caseStudy %}
      <a href="/work/{{ project.slug }}/" class="card__link">Read case study →</a>
      {% endif %}
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <p class="projects__note">
    Client names above are anonymized — most of this work was delivered for enterprise clients under
    confidentiality, so source repos aren't public. Case studies describe the engineering in full detail.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="section container" id="skills" data-reveal>
  <p class="section__eyebrow">04 · skills</p>
  <h2 class="section__title">Skills &amp; Tech Stack</h2>
  <div class="skills__grid">
    <div class="skills__group">
      <p class="skills__group-title">Cloud &amp; Infrastructure</p>
      <div class="skills__chips">
