        <span class="chip">Kustomize</span><span class="chip">Helm</span><span class="chip">Kyverno</span>
        <span class="chip">Gateway API</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="skills__group">
      <p class="skills__group-title">CI/CD &amp; Supply Chain Security</p>
      <div class="skills__chips">
        <span class="chip">Cloud Build</span><span class="chip">Docker</span><span class="chip">Hadolint</span>
        <span class="chip">Trivy</span><span class="chip">Grype</span><span class="chip">Syft</span>
        <span class="chip">Cosign</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="skills__group">
      <p class="skills__group-title">Observability &amp; SRE</p>
      <div class="skills__chips">
        <span class="chip">Cloud Monitoring</span><span class="chip">Prometheus</span>
        <span class="chip">Grafana</span><span class="chip">PagerDuty</span><span class="chip">Slack alerting</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="skills__group">
      <p class="skills__group-title">Languages &amp; Scripting</p>
      <div class="skills__chips">
        <span class="chip">Python</span><span class="chip">Bash</span><span class="chip">Go</span>
        <span class="chip">YAML/JSON</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="skills__group">
      <p class="skills__group-title">Everyday Tooling</p>
      <div class="skills__chips">
        <span class="chip">Git</span><span class="chip">GitHub</span><span class="chip">Linux</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section container" id="writing" data-reveal>
  <p class="section__eyebrow">05 · writing</p>
  <h2 class="section__title">Writing</h2>
  <div class="writing__list">
    <div class="writing__item">
      <a href="https://medium.com/@lokeshdangi/in-terraform-how-can-i-use-a-modules-output-as-input-d41963590cf5" target="_blank" rel="noopener">In Terraform, how can I use a module's output as input?</a>
      <span class="writing__date">Medium</span>
    </div>
    <div class="writing__item">
      <a href="https://medium.com/@lokeshdangi/how-to-create-a-linux-command-a-step-by-step-guide-30696eab9c34" target="_blank" rel="noopener">How to Create a Linux Command</a>
      <span class="writing__date">Medium</span>
    </div>
    <div class="writing__item">
      <a href="https://medium.com/@lokeshdangi/streamlining-database-creation-a-postgresql-tale-with-random-database-generator-fc8579f5d328" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Streamlining Database Creation: A PostgreSQL Tale</a>
      <span class="writing__date">Medium</span>
